  <!-- How the company began: three paragraphs; the founding year waits for the company -->
  <section id="how-it-began" class="section" aria-labelledby="began-h">
    <div class="wrap grid gap-8 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:gap-16">
      <h2 id="began-h" class="h2 lg:col-span-5">How the company began</h2>
      <div class="story lg:col-span-7">
        <p>Lightening Lives grew out of more than 25 years of work in genetic and molecular diagnostics, alongside clinicians, the health ministry and its district health authorities, NGOs, universities and companies.</p>
        <p>Over those years one thing kept showing. The people who most need a genetic diagnosis are often the least likely to get one, because the test needs a laboratory, equipment and specialists that their district does not have.</p>
        <p>We started the company to develop tests that do not need them. The first, for sickle cell anaemia, was built for the National Sickle Cell Anaemia Elimination Mission, approved by ICMR, and patented in India and Japan. More have followed, for the other haemoglobinopathies and for the musculopathies.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Why, how and what: three columns -->
  <section id="why-how-what" class="section bg-paper" aria-labelledby="why-how-what-h">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h2 id="why-how-what-h" class="h2 max-w-[44rem]">Why, how and what, in that order</h2>
      <ul class="audiences mt-12">
        <li>
          <h3 class="h3">Why</h3>
          <p>The burden of genetic disorders is large, and testing is hard to reach: too far, too slow, too costly, too dependent on infrastructure. A different kind of test can change that.</p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <h3 class="h3">How</h3>
          <p>By making genetic and molecular tests robust, simple, affordable and easy to use, with a sample that is easy to take, a result that needs no second test, and results that come back quickly.</p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <h3 class="h3">What</h3>
          <p>Tests that make early diagnosis practical, newborn screening above all, so that treatment starts on time. And tests that make carrier screening and counselling routine, so that fewer families meet a genetic disorder unprepared.</p>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Mission and vision: the home page's vision band, with the mission above the vision -->
  <section id="mission-and-vision" class="vision" aria-labelledby="mission-h vision-h">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div>
        <h2 id="mission-h" class="label">Our mission</h2>
        <p class="vision-line">To make molecular diagnosis accessible to all by developing innovative REASSURED genetic tests, with simple, affordable, minimally invasive sample collection and a quick turnaround for results.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="mt-12 lg:mt-16">
        <h2 id="vision-h" class="label">Our vision</h2>
        <p class="vision-line">To make precision genetic diagnosis accessible to every individual, through innovative technologies that need only a single drop of blood.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

